{"html":"<h1 id=\"vkf-symbolic-comparison-evidence\">VKF symbolic comparison evidence</h1>\n<p>Compiler: <code>VKF 0.4.5</code> Host: <code>AMD EPYC 7763 64-Core Processor</code>, linux-x64 Samples: 10 per kernel/language; timeout: 30000 ms</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Kernel</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF mean ± std</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / symengine</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / sympy</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / symbolics</th><th scope=\"col\">Measurement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>expand1</td><td>9.984 ± 0.129 ms</td><td>0.178×</td><td>7.22e-4×</td><td>&lt;3.33e-4×</td><td>measured</td></tr><tr><td>expand2</td><td>111.793 ± 2.372 ms</td><td>0.313×</td><td>&lt;0.004×</td><td>0.029×</td><td>measured</td></tr><tr><td>add1</td><td>0.651 ± 0.021 ms</td><td>0.003×</td><td>0.016×</td><td>7.04e-4×</td><td>measured</td></tr><tr><td>series</td><td>3.984 ± 0.083 ms</td><td>0.030×</td><td>0.035×</td><td>0.003×</td><td>measured</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Ratios are VKF operation time divided by competitor operation time on this host. No performance threshold is enforced. A <code>&lt;</code> ratio uses the competitor timeout as a conservative lower bound; no timeout is presented as a measured mean. Ratios below 0.001 use scientific notation so a nonzero measurement is never displayed as zero.</p>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"VKF symbolic comparison evidence","id":"vkf-symbolic-comparison-evidence"}],"examples":[],"source":"benchmarks/symbolic-comparison/results/linux-x64-045.md","route":"benchmarks/symbolic-0.4.5.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.7","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.7","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=bc7ba614314bd6ac80d98237740b71df7be8371008bf5cf14facb50932f8e962"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.7","tag":"v0.4.7","status":"published","b